Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗  孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, kids?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了船长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了船长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.74,0:00:21.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是谁住在深海的大菠萝里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:21.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who lives in a pineapple under the sea?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,方方黄黄伸缩自如
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Absorbent and yellow and porous is he
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.79,0:00:29.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果四处探险是你的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:29.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If nautical nonsense be something you wish
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.76,0:00:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就敲敲甲板让大鱼开路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then drop on the deck and flop like a fish
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.09,0:00:34.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:34.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.26,0:00:34.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:34.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ready
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.88,0:00:44.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:44.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:49.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1179.518,406)}海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:54.71,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,老奶奶的秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:56.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(272.885,461.542)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:01:00.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:56.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(486.25,710.796)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.71,0:00:58.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(402.512,448.505)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.71,0:00:58.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(526.262,692.522)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:00.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(436.012,527.605)}客串
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(430,527.783)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:04.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1068.97,636.549)}荫凉滩疗养院
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.39,0:01:07.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再喂一点好吗  小痞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:07.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about a little more, Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.94,0:01:11.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是说你今晚不想再喂奶奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:11.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or has this old granny had enough for one night?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, gramma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.04,0:01:15.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想吃多少布丁我都给
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:15.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you know I always have more pudding for you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.37,0:01:20.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样可真是不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:20.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That looks simply delightful
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.04,0:01:20.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你曾经跟我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:20.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You once told me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.98,0:01:24.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是你从小最爱的口味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:22.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that this was your favorite flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:24.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,growing up as a child
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,定量供应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ration?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.91,0:01:26.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:26.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,张嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Open up
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.81,0:01:37.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嘴巴可以松开勺子了  奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:37.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can let go of the spoon now, gramma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.53,0:01:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你脸上好像沾到了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got a little on your face
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, let me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.91,0:01:44.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:44.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.21,0:01:46.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:46.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, darling
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.23,0:01:51.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板啊  你永远都是我最爱的孙女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Plankton, you always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:51.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,were my favorite granddaughter
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.21,0:01:54.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她五分钟后得睡觉  痞先生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:54.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Five minutes until bedtime, Mr. Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.50,0:01:57.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶  刚刚那是最甜美最温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:57.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, gramma, that's the sweetest, most tender--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五分钟  痞先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Five minutes, Mr. Pla--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你第一次念我就听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I heard you the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚说到哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶  别忘了你的牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gramma, don't forget your teeth
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, now, gramma
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just relax
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.49,0:02:19.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:19.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, there
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.94,0:02:39.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先前怎么就没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:39.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of this before?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.74,0:02:43.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有谁能拒绝这么个无助的小太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.74,0:02:43.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one can say no to a helpless little grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.75,0:02:46.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.75,0:02:46.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sonny
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.12,0:02:48.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很想要你那个蟹什么堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:48.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd simply love one of your krabby whatsits
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.45,0:02:52.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我消化系统太娇弱  有特殊需求
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:52.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but my delicate digestive system has special needs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.09,0:02:55.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得把秘方完完整整看一遍才行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:55.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'll need to see a complete list of ingredients
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.72,0:02:56.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总不能让我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:56.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.74,0:02:59.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整晚胀得疼  睡不着觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:59.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to be up all night with painful bloating, would you?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Goodness, no
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here ya are
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.44,0:03:05.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:05.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, sonny
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.63,0:03:07.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得把它带回家去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:07.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to take it home
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,双光眼镜落家里了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I left my bifocals there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.45,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 双光眼镜：近视眼镜与老花眼镜的结合 ]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.45,0:03:13.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(497.382,395.208)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直接命中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A direct hit
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,威胁已消除  上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Threat neutralized, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收到  完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Roger, over
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上来  上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right away, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.41,0:03:35.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全体都有  准备下潜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.41,0:03:35.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare to dive
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.74,0:03:37.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重复  准备
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:37.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repeat, prepare to--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, lady
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.16,0:03:49.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不认得我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:49.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不太认得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.25,0:03:55.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我  你亲爱的老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:55.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me, your dear old great-grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.81,0:03:58.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:58.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick, come inside
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.55,0:04:02.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来是我的老姑婆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:02.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My very own great-grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们咋没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why have we never met?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.38,0:04:07.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想了解你的生活  你的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:07.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to know all about your life, your job
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.25,0:04:09.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密配方在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:09.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where the secret formula is--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.12,0:04:10.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:10.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.38,0:04:16.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你回来了  曾老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:16.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you came back, double-great-grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.65,0:04:20.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你着凉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:20.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're cold
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.67,0:04:23.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来把你舒舒服服地裹好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:23.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap you up in something nice and cozy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.94,0:04:27.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,往前靠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:27.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, lean forward
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.87,0:04:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There we go
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再往后靠  老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, lean back, grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.35,0:04:36.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是我最舒服的枕头了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:36.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the coziest pillow I have
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.98,0:04:44.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不一起来看看从前拍的家庭相册
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:44.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about we look through some old family photo albums?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.15,0:04:50.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这张照片拍的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:50.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's a picture of me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,长出了第一个附属器官
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when I developed my first appendage
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.93,0:04:54.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,相册拍得很棒吧  曾老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:54.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty neat photo album, eh, double-g-grammy-maw?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.95,0:04:57.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:57.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was certainly interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.68,0:05:00.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我更想听听看你最近有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:00.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to hear about your more recent affairs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.85,0:05:02.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就比如说你在哪上班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.85,0:05:02.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like where you work, for instance
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.98,0:05:04.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:04.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.61,0:05:05.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上班的照片我也拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:05.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got pictures of that too
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过先再看几张我小时候的照片再说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:07.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we have a couple more
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from my early childhood to get through first
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.58,0:05:12.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别说我没为这份行当吃过苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never let it be said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I didn't suffer for my occupation
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.48,0:05:27.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:27.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great-grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.05,0:05:31.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做了一生中最恐怖的噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:31.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had the most horrible dream of my life
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我打扮成了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was dressed up as--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.78,0:05:36.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王的妈啊  是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.78,0:05:36.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,holy mother of Neptune, it's true
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去准备早餐一起来吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll go and fix us a nice breakfast
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.93,0:05:43.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃完过后整天待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:43.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then we'll spend the whole day together
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds delightful
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.03,0:05:52.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:52.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这种老当益壮的老人家喜欢做啥事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what kinds of things do you active seniors like to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实在的  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.74,0:06:00.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说过我想看你的生活  忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:06:00.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said I wanted to see your life, remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.70,0:06:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想了解你的生活  你的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to know all about your life, your job
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密配方在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where the secret formula is--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.90,0:06:09.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:09.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.82,0:06:11.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不必
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:11.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,估计你也不怎么喜欢那种玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly care about any of that stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的生活一定更充实更刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your life must be way more full and exciting
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.68,0:06:17.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:17.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.01,0:06:20.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定可好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:20.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll be fun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1121.114,491.743)}老奶奶茶馆
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,茶好喝不  姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't this tea delicious, grandma?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.75,0:06:30.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:30.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, yes
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这种垃圾怎么喝得下去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How can you drink this dreck?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.09,0:06:35.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:35.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.45,0:06:42.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想说的是  再来一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:42.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What I meant to say was, "more, please"
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.28,0:06:51.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,针织圈子可真好玩  对吧老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:51.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Knitting circles sure are fun, eh, grammy-maw?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你为什么不开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you not having fun?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.24,0:06:54.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:54.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我不会针织  你个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because I don't knit, you nitwit
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你做的围巾可好看了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause you make a real nice scarf
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老姑婆  你又赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great-grammy-maw, you win again
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.80,0:07:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牌神万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All hail the great canasta-masta
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.87,0:07:15.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姑婆  你无聊了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:15.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma, you gettin' bored?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.68,0:07:17.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没  只是饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:17.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I'm getting hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.58,0:07:20.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我感觉胃酸都要把内脏给化了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:20.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can feel my own stomach acids eating away at my organs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都能吃一个村了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could eat a village
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.01,0:07:24.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不要来吃吃蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:24.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you settle for a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would I?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.07,0:07:35.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然要了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:35.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:38.60,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(494,238)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.36,0:07:42.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你介不介意走后门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:40.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, would you mind terribly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if we used the rear entrance?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.76,0:07:45.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有点怕生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:45.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a little shy around new people
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老姑婆  我们家祖祖辈辈都长触角吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, grammy, do antennae run in our family?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.52,0:07:49.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,触角
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:49.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Antennae?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.38,0:07:49.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:49.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.74,0:07:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没  我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:50.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,no, I--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.84,0:07:53.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她真的好怕生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:53.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She really is shy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.96,0:07:56.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能走后门的就只有我和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:56.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever uses this door except for me and--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.35,0:07:56.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:56.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  早就警告过你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you have been warned
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放假期间别在这鬼鬼祟祟的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about lurking back here on your days off
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是带我的老姑婆来这吃午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just bringing in my great-grammy-maw for some lunch
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.60,0:08:06.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:06.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your what?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.29,0:08:08.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:08.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My great-grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她一定是躲起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She must be hiding
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她说过自己怕生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, she did say she was shy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.08,0:08:12.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:12.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.04,0:08:16.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我保证不找蟹老板告状
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:16.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I promise not to tell Mr. Krabs about this
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.65,0:08:17.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,条件是你保证
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:17.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if you promise
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.74,0:08:21.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后半天别再让我看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:21.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I don't have to see you again for the rest of the day
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老姑婆  你在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grammy, there you are
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都开始担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was starting to worry
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用管
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快带我进厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just get me into that kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, here it is
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.27,0:08:36.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:36.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At last
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姑婆  我得去检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma, I'm just gonna go make sure
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卫生间里的用品配齐了没  一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the restrooms are stocked, you know, real quick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这也是我放假期间的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's part of my day-off duties
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.56,0:08:45.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  那我就站在这等你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:45.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be standing right here when you get back
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会跑到哪去到处乱转
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and not off somewhere snooping around
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.34,0:08:48.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷看秘密配方什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:48.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the secret formula or anything
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.03,0:08:50.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:50.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.41,0:08:51.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:51.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.17,0:08:51.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你去检查吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:51.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒要看看这个托儿有多好使
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see how this decoy floats your boat
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老姑婆  检查完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, grammy-maw, that's taken care of
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.01,0:09:15.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:15.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.11,0:09:17.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:17.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,grammy-maw?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.16,0:09:21.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她一定是自己先去收银机那边了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:19.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She must have made her own way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,up to the cash register all by herself
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.90,0:09:24.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁现在有空  还是先把碗盘洗了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll catch up on my dishwashing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:24.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while I have the chance
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王员工手册建议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab manual says it is always a good idea
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要先打开垃圾铰碎器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to start by turning the garbage disposal on
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以防水槽里有残留的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just in case there is any leftover rubbish in the sink
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好像有什么东西卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds like there's something stuck in the--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.81,0:09:38.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:38.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不敢看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't bear to look
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.87,0:09:49.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,曾老姑婆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:49.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, double-great-grammy-grams
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你又软又脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you were so soft and fragile
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.08,0:09:52.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:52.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like a--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.96,0:09:53.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:53.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like a--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.39,0:09:55.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:55.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like a--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.65,0:09:57.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像个气球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.65,0:09:57.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a balloon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.52,0:10:00.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:00.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, up here
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.75,0:10:03.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:03.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.49,0:10:05.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:05.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm all right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.97,0:10:07.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我被磨成了浆糊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:07.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I've been ground to a pulp
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.14,0:10:12.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是附近能有个凉爽又安全的好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:12.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If only there was a nice, cool, safe place nearby
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.19,0:10:15.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就比如保险库
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like a safe nearby
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就能好好休息  好好恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where I could rest and recover
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真有个保险库
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, there is the safe
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.33,0:10:21.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板在里面存了蟹黄堡的秘密配方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:21.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where Mr. Krabs keeps the krusty krab secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.72,0:10:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板过去好多年来都想偷走它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:22.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that Plankton's been trying to steal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the past bunch of years
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.59,0:10:25.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他应该不会介意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:25.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'd mind
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的老姑婆在那里休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if my dear old grammy-maw rests in there
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么好介意的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would he?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.98,0:10:31.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:31.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.87,0:10:33.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我等会过来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:33.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you a little later
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经感觉好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I feel better already
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你做个美梦  老姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams, grammy-maw
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝我做个美梦吧  白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams indeed, fool
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.79,0:10:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是这个美梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only this dream
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.72,0:10:55.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就要变成蟹老板的噩梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:55.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is about to become a nightmare for Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:02.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986.74,260.461)}秘密配方
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要好好享受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to savor this moment
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.85,0:11:05.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我一生就这么一次  就这么一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:05.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because for once in my life, for once in my life
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真正充满了活力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I feel truly alive
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.92,0:11:10.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:10.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.57,0:11:16.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你太不乖了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:16.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've been a very naughty boy, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶  我能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gramma, I can--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.03,0:11:23.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一直都在找这些玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:23.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been looking all over for this stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶  我能解释
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gramma, I can explain
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谅你也解释得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小痞  我跟你讲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton Jr., you know
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你向来都是个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you always were a--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,姑婆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你抓到痞老板了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You caught Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我猜猜看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me guess
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.71,0:11:38.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想偷秘密配方是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:38.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to steal the secret formula, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.91,0:11:41.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我让开  小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.91,0:11:41.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, rapscallion
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.97,0:11:45.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天的闹剧我已经受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:45.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've had enough foolishness for one day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.38,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,财迷心窍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(252.25,437.407)\frz28.96}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:59.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(486.25,710.796)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:59.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(398.5,410.294)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:59.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(522.25,654.311)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:01.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.96\pos(430,527.783)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:01.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Gare
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为你拉完了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you were done
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村的这一带真是没落了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This side of town sure has gone downhill
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.67,0:12:21.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:21.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.90,0:12:23.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:23.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.53,0:12:25.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是  放松一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:25.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, unwinding
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,享受免费停车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,enjoying the free parking
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(541.504,686.828)}免费停车
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.38,0:12:33.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你家小动物怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:33.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's happening to your critter there?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.95,0:12:35.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:35.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过小蜗每次这样子都会找到硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but whenever he does that, he finds change
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,硬币  是法定货币吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Change, as in legal tender?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, watch
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.41,0:12:45.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可震惊到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:45.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, shiver me shell wax
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就像个金钱探测
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're like a little money-detecting--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.84,0:12:50.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个叫啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:50.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you call it--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.41,0:12:51.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,锅牛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:51.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sneagle
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.01,0:12:51.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是说蜗牛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:51.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean snail?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.87,0:12:53.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.17,0:12:55.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你为什么不带着小锅牛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:55.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why don't you ever bring your little sneagle
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起来上班
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to work with ya?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你说宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because you said that pets
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全就是带病的害虫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,were nothing but disease-carrying vermin
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.44,0:13:00.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝对不能带进工作岗位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:00.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that should never be brought to the workplace
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以前是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But that was
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但现在我发现宠物还有这般才能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before I knew they had such an incredible talent
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.15,0:13:06.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实  不过不知怎么的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:06.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, but for some reason
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.78,0:13:09.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗这样子会非常不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:09.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the whole process causes Gary great discomfort
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不忍心让小蜗受那种罪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could never do that to him
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.49,0:13:12.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我忍心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:12.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:14.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(417.158,415.321)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.72,0:13:17.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:17.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把钱吸过来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bring in that change
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.64,0:13:30.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我找这枚找了好几个月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:30.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been working on this one for months
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.84,0:13:35.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笑什么呢  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:35.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.71,0:13:38.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:38.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.45,0:13:40.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说你不是应该要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:40.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, aren't you supposed to be
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到后头把垃圾箱刮干净吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out back scraping out the dumpster?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.72,0:13:42.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干干净净了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:42.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Done and done
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.78,0:13:45.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样的话就回去把船尾甲板擦干净
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then get back there and swab the poop deck, so to speak
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.69,0:13:46.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:46.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干嘛拿我钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with my change?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.26,0:13:54.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:54.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your change?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,掉在地上的东西  谁捡到就是谁的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything on the floor be fair game
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看样子得来个装口袋的口袋了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like I need pockets for me pockets
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's everybody going?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.22,0:14:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.05,0:14:17.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:17.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.25,0:14:18.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:18.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们通通给我走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on, the lot of ya
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有我的金币探测锅牛  还要你们干啥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:22.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With me new money finder here, who needs ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:23.93,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(377.048,602.36)}关
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.12,0:14:25.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正我也要打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:25.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was about to close up shop anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(377.048,602.36)}开
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.16,0:14:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打烊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Close up?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.10,0:14:27.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:27.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, gare
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.96,0:14:28.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:28.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're going with me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.20,0:14:31.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还不能把它给带走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:31.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not taking him home with ya just yet
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.97,0:14:34.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还没给炸锅除油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:34.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You haven't degreased the fryer
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.44,0:14:35.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶紧给我进去除油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:35.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, get in there and do it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.67,0:14:36.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没除完不准找我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:36.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to see you till you do
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  但
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah but--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.15,0:14:39.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别担心你家小杰了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:39.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and don't worry about Jerry here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今晚一定会遛它的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure he gets his nightly crawl
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.72,0:14:42.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:42.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.10,0:14:55.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:55.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,管它钱脏不脏  照样能用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dirty money spends just like the clean stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.25,0:15:08.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你来这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:08.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我把
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I finished the--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把炸锅擦干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I finished scrubbing the fryer, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干活还挺利索的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sure made easy work of it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.96,0:15:19.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去跟我被烫卷了的手说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:19.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try telling that to my frizzled hands
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续工作去  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to keep working, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.16,0:15:22.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:22.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.76,0:15:23.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:23.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然你就
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you, um
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.07,0:15:27.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把墙上的铆钉从小到大再排一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:27.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,rearrange the wall rivets from smallest to largest?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尺寸不是都一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't they the same size?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那都是商家故意骗你的  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what they want you to believe, boyo
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.69,0:15:35.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快回蟹堡王去仔细看铆钉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:35.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, get back in there and take a long look
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命船长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Will do, cap'n
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱们继续来寻宝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now back to our little treasure hunt, eh, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.44,0:15:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事吧  小巴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You okay, Barry?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.38,0:15:51.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:51.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attaboy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:54.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(415.154,425.375)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.55,0:15:54.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:54.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs was right
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有好几颗铆钉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A couple of these rivets
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.25,0:15:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尺寸误差高达五纳米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:15:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are off by as much as five nanometers
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上开工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd better get to work
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没时间让你偷懒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We ain't got time for that
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.64,0:16:13.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还得再洗劫一家洗衣店呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:13.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a laundromat that needs to be cleaned out
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.07,0:16:15.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗劫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:15.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cleaned out
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.34,0:16:16.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听懂没
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:16.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.41,0:16:18.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.41,0:16:18.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.08,0:16:18.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,驾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:18.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mush
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.78,0:16:22.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你不走  我就
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:22.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you don't get moving, I'm gonna--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.51,0:16:23.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就要干什么  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.51,0:16:23.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna do what, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.84,0:16:29.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就给它吃蜗牛点心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:29.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was gonna give him a snaily treat
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.57,0:16:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.57,0:16:39.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,铆钉重新排好了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:39.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those rivets are all rearranged, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.51,0:16:41.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:41.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, then
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.84,0:16:46.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在要你去粉刷蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:46.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,now I want you to paint the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.28,0:16:48.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:48.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's easy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是你必须用牙刷来粉刷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I want you to do it with this toothbrush
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.76,0:16:53.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:53.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  小老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, little pal
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别担心小泰了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about Terry
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它在我蟹爪里很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's in good claws
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一看就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.75,0:17:04.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:04.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小锅牛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, little sneagle
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.65,0:17:09.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好去洗钱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:09.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are you ready to do some laundry?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's my change?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.33,0:17:25.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒霉透了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:25.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that stinks
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他一定没料到这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll bet he didn't see that coming
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.77,0:17:32.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:32.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.85,0:17:35.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(782.172,346.94)}欢乐游戏厅\N全场游戏两毛五
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.82,0:17:40.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,踏破铁鞋无觅处  得来全不费工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:40.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just found the pot at the end of the rainbow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:49.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(559.554,447.5)}硬币
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.44,0:17:55.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:55.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跟从小宝宝手上抢糖果一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just like taking candy from a baby
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后就嗖的一下飞到那边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then it went whoosh over there
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.81,0:18:06.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,硬币就从机器那边飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:06.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the coins just flew from the machine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.85,0:18:07.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:07.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.78,0:18:09.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们会查明的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:09.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll get to the bottom of this
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要被发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're on to us
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实施B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for plan "b"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.52,0:18:18.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:18.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That should do it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.19,0:18:25.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好去找蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:25.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I better check in with Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问下还有没有不可能的任务要完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and see if he needs me to do any more impossible stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.56,0:18:31.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:31.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.99,0:18:34.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我回家  肯定会被唠叨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:34.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hear the end of this when I get home
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.34,0:18:35.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:35.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.45,0:18:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有没有看到一只遛蜗牛的螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:36.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a krab walking around with a snail, have you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.36,0:18:40.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你跟那俩小偷是一伙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:40.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, are you in with those thieving criminals too?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.90,0:18:41.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:41.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thieving what?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那两个浑蛋偷了我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Them two jerks what stole my money
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.05,0:18:47.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胖的那位靠他的锅牛把我硬币劫走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:47.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The fat one used his sneagle to swipe my coins from me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的锅牛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His sneagle?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.72,0:18:49.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:49.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,硬币全吸到锅牛壳上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, the coins were stickin' right to its shell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:55.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(782.172,346.94)}欢乐游戏厅\N全场游戏两毛五
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.56,0:18:59.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你对我家小蜗做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:59.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, what have you done to my Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来罪恶的温床长这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So this is what a hotbed of sin looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:07.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(752.09,308.729)}洗手间
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.40,0:19:10.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:10.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How's it going, boyo?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.60,0:19:13.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感应到硬币了没
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:13.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You feeling the coin vibes?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说不舒服是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you don't feel so good?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看你气色好得很
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You look fine to me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.51,0:19:28.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别这么孩子气了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:28.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, quit being such a baby
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开始给我赚钱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and start making me some money
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.97,0:19:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.67,0:19:32.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:32.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.63,0:19:33.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孕妇借过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pregnant lady coming through
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.24,0:19:38.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:38.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.87,0:19:42.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孕妇真是好难当
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:42.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It sure is hard being preggers
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好淋钱雨吧  我的小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get ready for a downpour, me boy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.18,0:20:23.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.18,0:20:23.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.75,0:20:26.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢各位给我送钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:26.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thank you for your money
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.06,0:20:29.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:29.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.73,0:20:33.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快  小哈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:33.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Harry
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.49,0:20:34.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:34.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let's go
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.32,0:20:37.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你给我快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:37.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, you
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要脸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For shame
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.73,0:20:42.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.73,0:20:42.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是在带小罗到处逛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just showing Rory off
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.33,0:20:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别骗我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you lie to me
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.30,0:20:48.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道你利用小蜗偷钱的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:48.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know all about your using Gary to steal money
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.57,0:20:51.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对没干过这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:51.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am doing nothing of the sort
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.74,0:20:53.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不偷东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.74,0:20:53.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would never steal
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.61,0:20:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别乱编故事了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have to quit making up stories, boyo
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才没乱编
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not making up anything
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.39,0:21:00.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的小算盘我都清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:00.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know all about your little scheme
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.77,0:21:02.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你才乱编故事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:02.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the one making up stories
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.38,0:21:12.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是还活要干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.38,0:21:12.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you have work you should be doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's rich
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(720,920)}有 钱
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要是真有钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, if I was rich
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.92,0:21:18.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不会雇你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:18.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have to hire the likes of you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.29,0:21:19.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的话太伤人了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:19.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's hurtful, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.85,0:21:20.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你心知肚明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:20.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you know it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你个可恶的黄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, you little yellow--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真想不到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I never
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.43,0:21:28.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想不到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:28.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You never what
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,学说文明用语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,learned to use decent language?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.21,0:21:42.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好久以前雇来的好小子怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:42.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to the sweet boy I hired so long ago?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.64,0:21:45.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:45.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.12,0:21:49.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中奖了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:49.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jackpot
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱  钱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money, money
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来爸爸这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come to papa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.23,0:22:02.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:02.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.13,0:22:07.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  他的状况十分不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.13,0:22:07.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's in pretty bad shape
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.47,0:22:08.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟被这一大堆金属撞了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:08.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with the impact of all that metal
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.94,0:22:10.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过他会康复的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:10.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but he'll pull through
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.17,0:22:12.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,医生  这种情况是怎么出现的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.17,0:22:12.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doctor, how does this sort of thing happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很有可能跟这个东西有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think this might have had something to do with it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:18.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(607.688,157.89)}美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩冰箱磁铁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My mermaid man and barnacle boy fridge magnet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.88,0:22:22.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是的  看样子你家宠物吞了它
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:22.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, it appears that your pet swallowed it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.15,0:22:24.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它的磁力异常强大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:24.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It has a very strong magnetic pull
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.69,0:22:28.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为本来就是磁铁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.69,0:22:28.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause it's a magnet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.19,0:22:29.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真相大白了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.19,0:22:29.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.39,0:22:32.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真想不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.39,0:22:32.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.86,0:22:35.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不幸的是  还有账单得要你付
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:35.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's still the matter of the bill
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.66,0:22:36.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:36.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.15,0:22:38.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我付不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.15,0:22:38.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't afford this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.52,0:22:38.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1058.942,155.879)}账单
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.19,0:22:43.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实  看样子你的钱刚好够付
